          2 x - 1
   (2)  ----------
         +---+
        \|2 x  - 1
                                                    Type: Expression(Integer)
a2 := 1 + sqrt(2*x)
 

         +---+
   (3)  \|2 x  + 1
                                                    Type: Expression(Integer)
